@@ -446,6 +446,16 @@ Here a list of the builtin loaders Jinja provides:
 
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.PackageLoader
 
+    Filesystem and package loaders normalize logical template names.
+    Both slash styles separate segments; empty and dot segments vanish,
+    and internal parent steps may return to the template root. Root
+    escapes, leading separators, and ASCII drive prefixes are rejected.
+    Missing or rejected requests report their original spelling.
+    Package directories and archives use the same logical name rules.
+    Configured encoding, physical filenames, and freshness semantics
+    remain unchanged. Environment caches retain the original request
+    name, so equivalent spellings may use separate compiled entries.
+
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.DictLoader
 
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.FunctionLoader
